    ],
    "text": "IT is hereby notified that His EXCELLENCY THE PRESIDENT has been pleased, to appoint the following persons asCommissioners of the Mediation Boards Commission, with immediate effect, under the provisions of Section 2 (1) ofthe Mediation Boards Act, No. 72 of 1988.",
    "fonts": [
